chip ym2608
clock 7987200
samples 40000
mem adpcm-a opna-rhythm.bin
fidelity min
# The rhythm sounds from the ROM image (synthetic, in the layout ymfm gives
# the chip's ROM) at the minimum fidelity: the total level, each drum in
# turn at its own level and pan, all six at once, a dump of some mid-sound,
# and the half-rate clocking of channels 5 and 6.
0 w 0 29 1 80 0 11 1 3f
0 w 0 18 1 df 0 10 1 01  # bass drum
4000 w 0 19 1 9c 0 10 1 02  # snare
8000 w 0 1a 1 5f 0 10 1 04  # top cymbal
12000 w 0 1b 1 d8 0 10 1 08  # high hat
16000 w 0 1c 1 c8 0 10 1 10  # tom
20000 w 0 1d 1 df 0 10 1 20  # rim shot
24000 w 0 18 1 df 0 19 1 df 0 1a 1 df 0 1b 1 df 0 1c 1 df 0 1d 1 df 0 10 1 3f  # all six
27000 w 0 10 1 85  # dump the bass drum and the high hat
30000 w 0 11 1 20 0 10 1 3f  # all six, softer
30500 w 0 10 1 ff  # dump them all
31000 w 0 10 1 2a
